bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/hearths.mem:259:# ''The next-three-receipts crossing — Codex Luna swarm, 2026-09-24.'' After `b69e2d983` made missing contract authority a tested strict floor, the active Codex Lares opens three non-substitutable red-first lanes. **D-VR-C:** establish a per-document worker storage boundary before any pin/recovery product claim; an ordinary observed parent document must leave zero worker-owned records. **Contract frontier:** carry the local contract-board/charter fold's accepted frontier explicitly to the gate; a clock, fleet credential, or guessed epoch never fills that absence. **Pronaos household reach:** reserve and inventory one Docker project before it mounts the finite public shore, then attribute public bytes and Node faces separately through normal and named-loss controls. Each lane must report an unavailable substrate rather than approximate its receipt; no lane decides DNS, reverse proxy, CRDT conflict, persona authority, or deployment governance. Files crossed now: this ledger and the Codex roadmap. Law: custody, relation authority, and delivery reach meet only after their independent witnesses hold.
bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/wiki-layer-ontology.mem:30:''Vocabulary law — nouns from OCI, verbs from residency canon.'' The stack's //structure// speaks the OCI layered-image standard (layers · write layer · registry · manifest), where a decade of operator intuition already lives. The stack's //motion// speaks the residency model's ACTION + archival surfaces (`residency-model#action-verb-surface`); version-control verbs MUST NOT name any crossing (`residency-model#five-pono-properties` §5 — the coordinate-space ruling).
