9:role      = "kit: K15 step 0, the custody contract before bytes move — the node and browser row census sorted D, F or S, the face custody key, the carrier binding, the overwrite contract, the one-face bundle, the reds per vessel, the build order and the open joints; drafted by a Sol-6 spirit over four research rounds, verified against code"
