74:| `public-handles` `node-vessel-identity.ts` | face-hot | ''D:'' the owner mapping of a face's own published record in its own row (`.persona-public-handles-h<N>.json`); public handle bytes ride their own signed record. |
76:| `face-address-secret` `fleet-join-custody.ts` | face-hot | ''D:'' the face's fleet address secret rests in that face, `face-address-secret-g<sha256 of its PersonaGroup>.bin`; the name's digest is the group digest the floor index holds. Local unless a defined face recovery route includes it. |
79:| `handle-book` `node-circle-store.ts` | face-hot | ''D:'' each face keeps its own recognition book in its own row (`.handle-book-h<N>.json`): the nyms it recognised and the private labels it keeps for them. A recognition reads and writes the worn face's book; a vessel wearing none recognises nobody, and a flat `.handle-book.json` reads as an earlier shape (refused by name, with the fresh-start runbook). `bundle: whole` carries the face's book. |
